Type: Package
Package: FraNchEstYN
Title: Crop-Disease Simulation and Calibration
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Simone", "Bregaglio", , "simone.bregaglio@crea.gov.it", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Roberto", "Ferrise", , "roberto.ferrise@unifi.it", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Provides an interface to run the FraNchEstYN C# crop–disease
    model from R. The package prepares inputs, executes simulations or
    calibrations, and collects outputs in tidy data frames for further
    analysis.
